  "applyDescription": {
    "source": "发帖提交网站名称、描述、地址和 Logo，管理员审核后会出现在这里。",
    "translations": {
      "en": {"text":"Post your site name, description, URL, and logo. It will appear here after admin review.","sourceRevision":"2b931e89a9820805454f525fd4bb229177f85fb2f75d849253d5ab08b3ddc1c5","reviewed":true},
      "ja": {"text":"サイト名、説明、URL、ロゴを投稿してください。審査後に掲載されます。","sourceRevision":"2b931e89a9820805454f525fd4bb229177f85fb2f75d849253d5ab08b3ddc1c5","reviewed":true},
      "it": {"text":"Pubblica nome, descrizione, URL e logo del sito. Apparirà dopo la revisione.","sourceRevision":"2b931e89a9820805454f525fd4bb229177f85fb2f75d849253d5ab08b3ddc1c5","reviewed":true},
      "ru": {"text":"Укажите название сайта, описание, URL и логотип. Ссылка появится здесь после проверки администратором.","sourceRevision":"2b931e89a9820805454f525fd4bb229177f85fb2f75d849253d5ab08b3ddc1c5","reviewed":true},
      "ko": {"text":"사이트 이름, 설명, URL 및 로고를 게시하십시오. 그것은 여기에 admin 검토 후 나타납니다.","sourceRevision":"2b931e89a9820805454f525fd4bb229177f85fb2f75d849253d5ab08b3ddc1c5","reviewed":true},
      "fr": {"text":"Postez votre nom de site, description, URL et logo. Il apparaîtra ici après la revue d’administration.","sourceRevision":"2b931e89a9820805454f525fd4bb229177f85fb2f75d849253d5ab08b3ddc1c5","reviewed":true}
    }
